Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what you're making. My dream time to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it? I\Nreally don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The crazy unknown there are no rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wild, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.98,0:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't do it, so\Ncan you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you cannot achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your wife that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, and you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that you gotta keep your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Moncherry, please be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.59,0:02:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see inside the palace\Nfrom all the way down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.36,0:02:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,With my clairvoyance, I can\Nsend my sight wherever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji would kill for that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this little princess\Ndoesn't give us a bunch of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo didn't paint a flattering picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Called her selfish and\Nobnoxious and mean-spirited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Kin'emon! Oh! Sir Usopp!\NYou know him? Yeah! Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a flying weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This man is Conis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I found him at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your, uh, riding bird looks\Nlike it's seen better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We were surprised at the state of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A great number of people seem\Nto be rushing to this plateau,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,though I could not discern the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Though honestly, I don't think\Nthey'll be able to climb up this high.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, long-nosed goblin man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that they were in need,\Nso I provided them a net.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I predict they will arrive here shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.62,0:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get\Nme killed, you moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,God, who stops going down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this net suck so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.96,0:04:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All those people are\Ncoming here to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What an awful blunder I've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My foolishness is truly peerless, And I\Ndid such a thing to my benefactor, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall commit Harakiri to show my regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjido, don't do it! Okay, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fix this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you might as well cut open your belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still one room I haven't checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to go back to Green Bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't anybody come save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Leo? Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have located the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw her deep in the palace,\Nhidden away, but she's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they hide her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's at the back of the chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The small room—remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,buried away in the dark—the naughty room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking of Princess Scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When we used to go visit the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Viola and I would pass mischief,\Nand then King Rick would scold her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Scarlet, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You got into trouble again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Naughty girl. Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even break the plate myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It was them we only broke it cuz\Nyou told us we could break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you could touch it\Nyou bunch of little dummies
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come and apologize with you\Nlater, sure anyway, aren't you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when we caused\Ntrouble, she was sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I got sidetracked there,\Nbut I remember the naughty room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Viola.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the enemy's base. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let this mission fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is the third\Nlevel right now, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:06:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,One more and we'll reach the flower field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been spotted! Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.46,0:07:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even all my most elaborate\Nfantasies couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,prepare me for the real-life Straw Heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rooster, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot roller!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the ability of the pup-pup fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm falling! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My yellow cups are down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.18,0:07:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather audacious, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking you can sneak up\Nto the palace on my watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Gladius!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Diez, blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:07:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, it's up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the key to law.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take care of the rest. Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Usopp, why must you strike me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who brought him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,are you still looking for something viola
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar has woken up. No,\Nit can't be. I beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean no one can\Nwithstand my special facial
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,jack-in-a-box technique I was sure she'd
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,be out cold for a couple of days at least
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the rest of your crew\Ndoesn't know anything
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,about her do they or her ability Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and Karin and his current\Ngroup are in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She's ready to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,IF you have a long nose,\Nthen stay out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Or on a second, now,\Nyou can just drop dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We just brought some snacks\Nin case you might be hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.74,0:09:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just sausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want something nice and round.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Like grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn you morons\Ninto headcracker dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go and protect the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll transform this whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They can all be toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.20,0:09:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And first, I'll get that long-nosed\Nbastard and the rest of his stupid crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Varul, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Horsey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.72,0:10:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Some gobs just pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Varul!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushed its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, my friend, don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It got back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Light of Beauty, round table!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They keep coming back, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,UFO!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Birds chirp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If I only had that key,\NI could finish this easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real noisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.26,0:12:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I got sloppy. It's you!\NMr. Luffy! A miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Nico! You're down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.98,0:12:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought the key, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she's just one little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she makes it to the palace,\Nshe won't be able to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill her when I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is Gladius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm putting an end to this rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Rooster, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy: Trafalgar Soldier, go on ahead\Nto the flower field, get that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can handle this, yep, you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's waiting—just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,like we made it to the fourth level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Robin's all right; her friends too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,too
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ussal and his allies are super tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They sure are. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to leave so suddenly, but we need\Nto rescue Princess Monchery right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay to leave you here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy and the others will\Nbe here soon anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong till we\Nput an end to all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Father must be out there\Nfighting right now, somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think you'd make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, let me take this one.\NRooster! Buried! Stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Those balls he throws are explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd blow up before you\Ncould bounce them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stairability!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it just for you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're facing the wrong way. Thanks, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're the best, and thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for being born.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a straight shot to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready, Trafalgar? Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.66,0:16:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare your concerns, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.74,0:16:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't die in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a score to\Nsettle with these monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Until my dear Farul is avenged, I\Nrefuse to take another step forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy, watch out! Bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a barrier, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Bartolomeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only make so much barrier at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm at my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I used every last inch\Nmaking those stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If it helps Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:17:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy even a little, then I'm\Nhappy to die right here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite the piece\Nof work, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough it out a bit and I'll guard you\Nuntil you can use your barriers again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any manners, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinco monos! Time to fetch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you, Brewster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our captain is something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd risk anything for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's our trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our key to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio fleur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gigantesco mano.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not laying a finger on my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No more screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite the odd one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you trying to stall us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like you\Nshould be complaining—how
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,long are you gonna keep\Nthis act up, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Old
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,man he says, well that's not\Nmy only disadvantage frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.48,0:19:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer to take things easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't discriminate among my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,kid though, I don't suppose you got your\Nposition by being kind to the elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,elderly
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My position doesn't require\Nme to be kind either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold this one against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.16,0:19:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gravity blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Raging Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Horizontal gravity?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You were holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is, I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you might say this is an\Nall-or-nothing gamble for me and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.86,0:20:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the stakes are as big as they get\Ni'm laying my life on the line
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,for this one that said i have to\Nget my dice in order to make my
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,roll because if i lose them the\Ngame is over before it even starts
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.34,0:20:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is deplorable, Rebecca.\NYou coward. Why do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,keep running you're a fighter\Naren't you sorry I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:21:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,gladiator I thought you\Nwere coming here to kill me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we put on some good entertainment\Nback at the Coliseum, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.78,0:21:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you won't fight me properly,\Nit's time I dispose of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you have nowhere to run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this a little more poetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca wasn't your mother,\Nalso—shot with a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,gun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me, soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilos!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You have taken enough from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.94,0:22:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This statue before you,\Nthis man was a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the greatest gladiator in the\Nwhole history of the Corrida Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret I couldn't\Nsave your mother's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.32,0:22:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but I will devote mine to\Nprotect yours, whatever the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Become strong, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As a mere toy without a future,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.90,0:23:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the only thing I could do\Nwas teach you how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it was hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a gentle soul\Njust like your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But you need no longer suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.98,0:23:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.58,0:23:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to elaborate on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.62,0:23:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiros!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.62,0:23:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't just stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.08,0:23:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay for your treachery!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.20,0:24:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.10,0:24:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.50,0:24:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.70,0:24:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.80,0:24:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.60,0:24:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The key!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.52,0:24:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.43,0:24:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.48,0:24:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.48,0:24:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The key!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.56,0:24:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.18,0:25:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.48,0:25:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.38,0:25:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thru! Thru!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.26,0:25:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.17,0:25:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.36,0:25:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.90,0:26:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.42,0:26:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the fourth\Nlevel where Mingo's hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.94,0:26:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's tear this place apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.80,0:26:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.06,0:26:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.97,0:26:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.18,0:26:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Diamante. Eeeh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.80,0:26:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Eeeh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.48,0:26:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You two go ahead without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.56,0:26:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a score to settle with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.80,0:26:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.62,0:26:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In my stead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.54,0:26:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
